{"id":10107,"name":"meowth-alola","speciesId":52,"dex":52,"form":"alolan","generation":1,"types":["dark"],"stats":{"hp":40,"attack":35,"defense":35,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":40,"speed":90},"abilities":[{"name":"pickup","hidden":false},{"name":"technician","hidden":false},{"name":"rattled","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":42,"baseExp":58,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10107.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10107.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10107.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10107.ogg","genus":"Scratch Cat Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon gato arranhado","flavor":[{"version":"shield","text":"It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn’t get along with Galarian Meowth."},{"version":"red","text":"Adores circular objects. Wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Appears to be more active at night. It loves round and shiny things. It can't stop from picking them up."},{"version":"gold","text":"It is fascinated by round objects. It can't stop playing with them until it tires and falls asleep."},{"version":"silver","text":"It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and se­ cretly hoards."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It loves things that sparkle. When it sees a shiny object, the gold coin on its head shines too."},{"version":"ruby","text":"MEOWTH withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light."},{"version":"emerald","text":"MEOWTH withdraw their sharp claws into their paws to silently sneak about. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light."},{"version":"firered","text":"All it does is sleep during the daytime. At night, it patrols its territory with its eyes aglow."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Adores round objects. It wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It is fascinated by round objects. It can’t stop playing with them until it tires and falls asleep."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and secretly hoards."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Meowth withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this Pokémon loves shiny coins that glitter with light."},{"version":"sun","text":"It lies around all day, becoming active near dusk. At night, it wanders the city in search of loose change."},{"version":"moon","text":"It loves shiny things. It often fights with Murkrow over prey they’re both trying to catch."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"When visiting a junkyard, you may catch sight of it having an intense fight with Murkrow over shiny objects."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It loves coins, so if you give it one, you can make friends with Meowth easily. But it’s fickle, so you can’t count on that friendship lasting."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Appears to be more active at night. It loves round and shiny things. It can’t stop itself from picking them up."},{"version":"sword","text":"It loves to collect shiny things. If it’s in a good mood, it might even let its Trainer have a look at its hoard of treasures."}],"flavorPt":"Adora colecionar coisas brilhantes. Se estiver de bom humor, poderá até deixar seu Treinador dar uma olhada em seu tesouro.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":255,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"meowth","speciesId":52,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28","Felicidade alta"],"species":"persian","speciesId":53,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Nível 28"],"species":"perrserker","speciesId":863,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":52,"name":"meowth","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/52.png"},{"id":10107,"name":"meowth-alola","form":"alolan","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10107.png"},{"id":10161,"name":"meowth-galar","form":"galarian","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10161.png"},{"id":10200,"name":"meowth-gmax","form":"gmax","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10200.png"}],"games":[17,18,19,20,25],"moves":[{"id":6,"learn":[[17,"lv",30],[18,"lv",30],[19,"lv",12],[19,"tm",0],[20,"lv",12],[20,"tm",0],[25,"lv",12]]},{"id":10,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[19,"lv",1],[20,"lv",8],[25,"lv",8]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":38,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":44,"learn":[[17,"lv",6],[18,"lv",6],[19,"lv",1],[19,"lv",3],[20,"lv",16],[25,"lv",16]]},{"id":45,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[19,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":85,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":86,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":87,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":91,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":95,"learn":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"id":97,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":103,"learn":[[17,"lv",17],[18,"lv",17],[19,"lv",23],[20,"lv",32],[20,"tm",0],[25,"lv",32]]},{"id":104,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"